// DRAFT (Act III, planning only). Ch20 U04 the release: Hesk. Ama asks whether anyone read her cords. Toma says he did
// (with Ysolde: ch12_ysolde_confessed); that they broke his faith; he thanks her for it. If ch15_toma_confessed and
// ch14_toma_refused: one more line. A believer honouring the believer who told the truth. The keth bundle goes last.
title: ch20_hesk_release
location: ch20/undertow_layers
---
@letterbox on
@camera U18
@music silence fade=1.0
Hesk as "Ama" [neutral]: Did anyone read my cords? #line:ch20_hesk_001 #tn:"Hesk speaks as Ama Quillo, an Ullari keth-reader, plainly devout."
@wait 2.0
<<if $ch12_ysolde_confessed>>
    Toma [neutral]: I did. Ysolde read them to me. All forty-seven. And the question. #line:ch20_hesk_002
<<else>>
    Toma [neutral]: I did. All forty-seven. And the question. #line:ch20_hesk_003
<<endif>>
Toma [sad]: They broke my faith. #line:ch20_hesk_004
@wait 2.0
Toma [tender]: Thank you. #line:ch20_hesk_005
<<if $ch15_toma_confessed and $ch14_toma_refused>>
    Toma [neutral]: I stopped saying it. "Be level." I say your count instead. #line:ch20_hesk_006
<<endif>>
@music release_sting fade=0.0
@vfx glimmer_lift at=hesk count=40 motion=spiral_up rate=slow
@wait 6.0
@vfx glimmer_lift at=keth_bundle count=1 motion=spiral_up rate=slow
@wait 4.0
<<set $ch20_hesk_released = true>>
@letterbox off
===
